<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">MIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Mika</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mik</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">MIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Lanebi Mika otito loke me nebi ikare marom aroma ki kare pa lanebi Icaya. Mika onongo a ki i taun mo acel matye i lobo Juda, matye i ker ma tung kupiny. En onongo dong otyeko niang woko ni kare pa Juda dong oromo wek opot i lakit peko acelu ma Amoc yam otito ni bipoto ikom ker me Icrael matye i te ker ma tung kumalo, dong pi tyen lok acelu, Lubanga bipwodo dano pi lok me ngolo kop ma pe atir ma opong ki adagadaga iwi loboni. Kwena pa Mika bene tye ki lok maber ki lanyut me gen pi kwo mabino i anyim.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dul coc ma opore dok ber me angeya en aye kama kicoyo lok ma loko ikom kuc pi lobo ducu matye i te loc pa Lubanga ma nonge i cura 4:1-4; ma tito pi Rwot madit atika ma bibino ki i ot pa Daudi ma en aye bikelo kuc bot rok ducu, ma nonge i cura 5:2-5a, ka dong tyeng acel keken ma dolo pol lok ducu ma lunebi me Icrael gubedo katito pire ni gin ma en mitoni watii en ene; en aye tiyo tic ma atir, bedo ki mar, ki dong wot kacel ki Lubanga ki mwolo. Cura 6:8</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop ikom Icrael ki ikom Juda <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 1:1-3:12">1:1—3:12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koko jo Icrael ki i opii ki kuc <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 4:1-5:15">4:1—5:15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwena me gwoke ki me gen <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 6:1-7:20">6:1—7:20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:32-16:20">2 Luk 15:32—16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18:1—20:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 27:1-7">2 Tek 27:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:1-32:33">28:1—32:33</ref></char>
    </note>Man lok pa Rwot ma ceng omiyo bot Mika Lamorecet i ginanyuta ma en oneno ma okemo Camaria ki Jerucalem, ikare me loc pa jo magi: Yocam, Akaj, ki Kejekia, ma gubedo luker me Juda.<verse eid="MIC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wer me koko pi Camaria ki Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2" />Wuwiny, wun rok ducu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">Wucik itwu wun jo ducu ma wubedo iwi lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">ki gin ducu matye iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">wek Rwot Lubanga obed caden ma nyutu bal ikomwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:2">kun loke winye ki i Ot mere maleng.<verse eid="MIC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3" />Pien nen, Rwot tye kabino nia ki i kabedone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:3">en bibino piny, ci binyono wi cere ma otinge iwi lobo.<verse eid="MIC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4" />Ci godi bileny ki i te tyene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:4">macalo odok kic ma inget mac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:4">ci bimol bicore i lung,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 1:4">macalo pii macore cito i lung.<verse eid="MIC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5" />Magi ducu bitime pi tim aranyi ki pi tim me jemo pa Yakobo ki pi bal me ot pa Icrael. Anga ma omiyo jo pa Yakobo gujemo ikom Lubanga? Pe en aye taun madit me Camaria? Bal me ot pa Juda ma omiyo gudonyo kaworo cal apayani kono tye iwi nga? Pe iwi taun madit me Jerucalem? <verse eid="MIC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6" />Pimeno Rwot waco kuman ni, “Abiloko Camaria doko obur ma i dye tim, dok bidoko kabedo me pito olok; dok abicoro gwengine piny i lung, ka dong abiyabo te gutine. <verse eid="MIC 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7" />Cal jogi apayagini ducu kibingidone woko matinotino; ki limgi ducu ma gucoko ma kiculugi pi bedo malaya ma i ot woro jogigi bene kibiwangogi woko ki mac. Pien jo Camaria guloke gudok kaworo cal jogi, pimeno lumerokgi dong bicoko gin ducu ma kiculugi pi malayagi ci gibiculu ki malaya me woro jogigi i lobo mukene.”<verse eid="MIC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8" />Ci Mika dok owaco ni, “Pi man abikumu, dok abikok. Abiwot ki tyena nono kun nongo atye munero. Abikok calo too, dok abikumu macalo udu. <verse eid="MIC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9" />Pien wang ret pa Camaria dong odoko tut ma pe twero cang, dok bene Juda bineno lakit can acelu; to dong otyeko o wa i dog cel pa jona, i dog cel me Jerucalem.”<verse eid="MIC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lamerok dong cok o i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10" />Pe wutit pire bot lumerokwa i Gat, pe wukoki wek dano pe gunge gin matye katime ikomwa; wun jo Bet-le-apra wungene piny i apwa me nyutu pi can ma opoto ikomwu. <verse eid="MIC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11" />Wun jo Capir, wucit anyim i lobo ma pe mewu, kun wuwoto munero ma lewic omakowu marac; wun jo ma bedo i Jaanan pe wukat woko. Ka wuwinyo koko ma winye a ki i Bet-ejel man nyutuni kalarewu dong peke kunu. <verse eid="MIC 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12" />Jo ma bedo i Marot gitye kakuru gin maber ki par madwong, pien gin marac ma oa ki bot Rwot dong oo cok ki dog cel me Jerucalem. <verse eid="MIC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13" />Wutwe aguragura ikom gadigadi lweny madwir, wun jo Lakic; pien wun aye jo mukwongo kelo bal ikom jo Cion, ki tim aranyi pa jo Icrael ceng kinongo ikomwu. <verse eid="MIC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14" />Pimeno wubimiyo mot me poke bot Morecet-gat;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="fk">Morecet-gat </char> te loke “Mot” nyo “Lim akumu” ileb Ibru. </note> odi me Akijib<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="fk">Akijib </char> te loke Goba. </note> bidoko gin bwola bot luker me Icrael. <verse eid="MIC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15" />Wun jo ma bedo i Mareca,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="fk">Mareca </char> cal ki nyiglok mo ileb Ibru ni “Laloyo.” </note> dok abikelo ikomwu jo ma bwoyowu wek guma taunwu madito woko. Luker pa Icrael bicito kakane iboro me Adullam. <verse eid="MIC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16" />Wun jo me Juda, wulyel yer wiwu woko kun wukumu pi lutino ma yomo cwinywu; wuwek wiwu otal woko macalo wi acut, pien kibimayo lutinowu woko ki botwu ci kibiterogi i opii.<verse eid="MIC 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Can ma bipoto ikom jo ma gidiyo lucan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1" />Gibineno can, jo ma gibedo ma wanggi twolo idye wor benebene pi yubu yub me timo gin marac, ma gipiro pi timo bal iwi kabutugi! Ka piny oru, ci gitimo, pien twerone tye i cinggi. <verse eid="MIC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2" />Giparo poti pa dano, ci gigamo woko tektek ki bot wegine; giparo odigu kadok gimayogi woko; gidiyo dano ki bura, ci gimayo wa ode, kadi wa lobo ma oleyo ki bot wone.<verse eid="MIC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3" />Pimeno Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Nen, atye kayubu lok marac ikom ot man, ma pe dok wubiwoto ngutwu ki iye; pe dok wubiwot kun wungate ki wake, pien kare meno bibedo kare marac.” <verse eid="MIC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4" />Inino meno kibiwerowu ki wer me agec, dok bene gibikoko koko me can, kun giwaco ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MIC 2:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">“Kityekowa woko dong atika;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">Rwot dong okwanyo lobo mayam opoko botwa woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">ci omiyo bot jo mukene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">En opoko potiwa woko ikin jo ma guterowa i opii.”<verse eid="MIC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5" />Pimeno ka kare biromo me dwoko ngom botwu wun jo pa Rwot, ci pe tye ngat mo ikinwu ma kibimiye dul lobo mo me bedo mere.<verse eid="MIC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6" />Dano gitito lok bota kun giwaca ni, “Pe itit lok meno ducu botwa, pe omyero itit kit lok macalo magi! Rwot pe bikelo lewic ikomwa matwal. <verse eid="MIC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7" />Ento wun jo ot pa Yakobo, wutamoni kicenowu woko ce? Wun mono wutamoni Rwot pe twero diyo cwinye? Wun wutamoni magi ducu obedo gin ma en aye otiyo? Pe wungeyoni en loko lok me kica bot ngat ma tiyo gin matye atir?”<verse eid="MIC 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8" />Ento Rwot odok iye kuman ni, “Wun wutware ikom jona macalo lukwor. Ka lumony gudwogo ki i dog lweny ikom merok ki yomcwiny, kun gitamo pi kuc keken, ento gin dok girwate ki lulonyo ma gin gugamo banya ki botgi kun gipido banyagi ci gimayo kanyigi woko ki ikomgi. <verse eid="MIC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9" />Wun wuryemo mon pa jona woko ki i odigi ma yomo cwinygini; ci wukwanyo wa gum pa lutinogi matino woko matwal ki botgi. <verse eid="MIC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10" />Wua, dong wuciti, pien man pe kayweyo. Balwu dong omiyo kabedo man odoko rac dok opore me abala. <verse eid="MIC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11" />Joni gimaro lanebi ma loko goba keken. En waco botgi ni, ‘Abititiwu ni kongo bwino ki mat mogo makec bibedo pol ata kany.’ Lanebi ma tye ki cwiny me goba aye biyomo cwiny jo man!<verse eid="MIC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12" />Ento abicoko wun ducu, wun jo pa Yakobo, abicoko jo Icrael ma odong; ci abiguruwu kacel macalo romi matye i dwolgi, macalo lwak romi ma gitye i olet, lwak jo ma gin woo.”<verse eid="MIC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13" />Lubanga biyabo yoo dok bitelo nyimgi; gibituru dog cel, ka gibikato woko. Rwotgi, ma en aye Lubangagi kikome aye bikato inyimgi, kun telo wigi.<verse eid="MIC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mika ojuku lutela pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1" />Ci awaco ni, wuwiny, wun ludito ma telo wi jo pa Yakobo ki wun luloc me ot pa Icrael! Pe ticwu aye me ngeyo ngolo kop atir? <verse eid="MIC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2" />Wun wukwero gin maber ento wumaro gin marac, wupwaco del kom jona, dok wudango ringo komgi ki ikom cogogi. <verse eid="MIC 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3" />Wun wucamo ringo kom jona, kun bene wuyango del komgi, dok wungido cogogi matitino, ka dong wungidogi woko macalo ringo ma kiketo i agulu, nyo macalo ringo ma tye i cupuriya. <verse eid="MIC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4" />Kare tye kabino ma wubikok bot Rwot, ento en pe bigamo dogwu; inino maca pe wubineno wange, pien timwu racu tutwal.<verse eid="MIC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5" />Man aye lok ma Rwot waco ikom lunebi ma gingako jone, ma gicike ni kuc bibedo ikom jo ma miyo botgi ginacama, ento giero lweny ikom jo ma gikwero miyogi ginacama. Rwot waco bot lunebi magi ni, <verse eid="MIC 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6" />“Wun lunebi, karewu dong tye cok mada; piny bibedo mutu botwu, pe wubineno ginanyuta mo, dok piny bidoko col kun pe wunongo lagam me gin mo. Ceng bipoto iwiwu, wun lunebi, piny bicido woko botwu.” <verse eid="MIC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7" />Lewic bimako lunen piny, ki lutyet bene kibiketo lewic iwigi; gin ducu gibimiyo doggi woko, pien Lubanga pe bimiyo botgi lagam mo.<verse eid="MIC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8" />Ento ki tung bota, atye ki tek i Cwiny pa Rwot, dok en miya cwiny me ngolo kop atir, ki teko, pi tito bene ki Yakobo tim aranyine, ki pi nyutu bot jo Icrael balgi. <verse eid="MIC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9" />Wuwiny man, wun lutela wi jo pa Yakobo ki wun luloc me ot pa Icrael, ma wudag ngolo kop atir kun wubalo te kop ducu matye atir, <verse eid="MIC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10" />ma wugero Cion ki lim ma wunongo ki tim me nek, ki Jerucalem bene ki tim marac. <verse eid="MIC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11" />Lutela wi jo ma i Jerucalem gingolo kop pi lim me wil i mung, ajwakine bene gipwonyo pwony pi mucara, lunebi bene gitucu lok me nebi pi lim; ento dok pud gijenge ikom Rwot kun giwaco ni, “Ada Rwot tye ikinwa! Rac mo pe bibino ikomwa.”<verse eid="MIC 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 26:18">Jer 26:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pimeno, pi tim mewu, Cion kibipuru woko macalo poto; Jerucalem bidoko obur, ki got ma kigero Ot pa Rwot iwiye bidoko bunga.<verse eid="MIC 3:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot biloyo lobo ducu ki kuc</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 2:2-4">Ica 2:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1" />Man bitime ikare ma pud tye anyim:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">got ma Ot pa Rwot tye ocung iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">bicung macalo got mabor makato godi ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">bore bikato cere ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">rok ducu gibimol gicito iye,<verse eid="MIC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2" />dok lwak lurok mapol gibibino, ci gibiwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">“Wubin, waitu iwi got pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">i Ot pa Lubanga pa Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">wek en opwonywa ki kit mere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">ka wek walub yone.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">Pien cik bia ki i Cion,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:2">dok lok pa Rwot bia ki i Jerucalem.<verse eid="MIC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 3:10">Joe 3:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>En bingolo kop ikin rok mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">dok bingolo kop pa lwak rok matego ma gitye kamabor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">gibiteto pala lucwangi doko lak kweri dyang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">ki tongigi doko pala me ngolo jang olok;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">rok mo pe bitingo pala lucwan ikom rok wadigi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:3">pe dong gibimede ki pwonyo lweny.<verse eid="MIC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 3:10">Jek 3:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dano acel acel bibedo ite olok ma mere ki ite odurune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:4">pe tye ngat mo ma bimiyo gibedo lwor;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:4">pien dog Rwot me mony dong ociko lok man.<verse eid="MIC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5" />Kadi rok ducu giwoto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:5">kun ngat acel acel woto i nying lubangane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:5">ento wan wabiworo Rwot Lubangawa pi nakanaka.<verse eid="MIC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koko jo Icrael ki i opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Inino maca abicoko lungolo, dok abicoko jo ma kiryemogi woko, ki jo ma an kikoma dong atyeko unugi ki i lobo me opii. <verse eid="MIC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7" />Abimiyo lungolo ma odong gidoko jo ma obwot, ki jo mayam kiryemogi gucito woko cen gin bidoko rok matek; abibedo lalocgi ki i got Cion nia ikare man nio wa inino ma pe tum.”<verse eid="MIC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8" />In Jerucalem, In aye lubele ma Lubanga gwoko iye jone macalo lakwat ma gwoko dwol romine, dok in cere pa jo Cion, loci macon bidwogo i cingi, ma en aye ker pa jo Jerucalem. <verse eid="MIC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9" />Gin ango ma omiyo itye kakok matek? Pingo icur acura ki arem macalo dako ma mwoc ogoyo ikare me nywal? Pe tye rwot mo ikinwu ce? Lumii tamwu dong guto woko ce?<verse eid="MIC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10" />Wubed ki arem, kun wucur, wun jo Cion, macalo dako ma rem ki nywal; pien dong wubia woko ki i gang, wubibedo i tim ata; dok wubicito i Babilon. Rwot bilarowu ki kunu, en bilarowu ki icing lukworwu. <verse eid="MIC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11" />Rok mapol dong gucoke ka lweny ikomwu, kun giwaco ni, “Wek wabal Jerucalem woko wek wanen kit ma Cion bidong obur kwede.” <verse eid="MIC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12" />Ento gin pe gingeyo tam pa Rwot. Gin pe bene giniang yube ni en aye ocokogi me miyogi pwod macalo kidino kwede wit kal ma i laro moyo.<verse eid="MIC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Wua malo wun jo Cion, wucit opot ikom lukworwu macalo twon dyang ma nyono wit kal me dinone, pien abimiyo tungwu doko calo nyonyo ki obong tyenwu bidoko calo mola. Wubingido rok mapol matinotino, wubidyero lonyogi ma gunongo i yo me geroni bota, an Rwot Lubanga me wi lobo ducu.”<verse eid="MIC 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1" />Wun jo Jerucalem wuwek mony mewu gucoke, pien dong kirumuwa woko dyere, lukworwa dong gurumuwa woko; dong gitye kagoyo lem laloc me Icrael ki odoo.<verse eid="MIC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubanga ociko me cwalo laloc ma bia ki i Beterekem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:6">Mat 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:42">Jon 7:42</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot waco kuman ni, “In Beterekem Eprata, in itidi mo pe ipore me bedo ikin kaka me Juda, ento dano ma bibedo laloc i Icrael bibino pi an kun a ki i in; ma tekwaro me kakane onongo tye ocake wacon i acaki piny.<verse eid="MIC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3" />Pimeno Rwot biweko jone ata i cing lukworgi nio ka kare biromo, nio ka dako matye karem ki nywal dong onywalo wode. Lacen utmegine ducu ma gubwot ki ikin jo ma kiterogi i opii gibidwogo bot jo Icrael ma gudong. <verse eid="MIC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4" />Ka en bibino, ci en bicung, dok biloyo jone pi tek pa Rwot, ki pi dit me nying Rwot Lubangane. Dok bene jone gibibedo ki kuc pien jo ducu ma iwi lobo gibiniang ikom dit ma mere <verse eid="MIC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5" />ci en bikelo kuc.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MIC 5:5">Lar ki pwod</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MIC 5:5">Ikare ma jo Aciria gibibino kamonyo lobowa, ma gin bituru cel gogowa woko, ci wan wabicwalo lutelawa ma gin oyita lweny katelo wi lwak ka lweny ikomgi. <verse eid="MIC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:8-11">Aca 10:8-11</ref></char></note> Ci gibiloyo lobo me Aciria ki pala lucwan, ki lobo pa Nimulodi bene ki pala lucwan ma gitingo, ci gibilarowa ki i cing jo Aciria ka gubino gumonyo lobowa, kadi bed nongo tyen gi onyono apoki me wang lobowa.<verse eid="MIC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7" />Lacen jo pa Yakobo ma gubwot gibibedo idye rok mapol macalo toyo ma oa ki bot Rwot, calo kot ma ngido ikom lum. Gin gibiketo gen gi ikom Lubanga, ento pe ikom dano adana. <verse eid="MIC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8" />Jo pa Yakobo ma gudong ikin rok mapol gibibedo macalo labwor ma dwaro lee ma i bunga, onyo ma ikin romi ma gucoke; ma ka owok ki ikin romi, ci nyonogi piny, dok kilogi woko, dok bene pe tye ngat mo ma larogi. <verse eid="MIC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9" />Icrael bitayo lukwore dok bityeko lumonene woko ducu liweng.”<verse eid="MIC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10" />Rwot waco kuman ni, “Inino maca, abikwanyo aguragurawu woko ki botwu, dok abityeko gadigadi lweny mewu woko. <verse eid="MIC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11" />Abityeko taun madito ducu ma i lobowu, dok abimuku cel gogo mewu matekgu woko ducu. <verse eid="MIC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12" />Abikwanyo tim me tyetwu woko ki i cingwu, dok pe wubibedo ki lukota ikinwu. <verse eid="MIC 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13" />Abikwanyo cal apaya mewu ki wir jogi mewu matye ikinwu, dok pe wubimede ki gungu piny kaworo tic me cingwu. <verse eid="MIC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14" />Abiputu wir ma wucomo woko ducu pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongoni Acera, dok abibalo taun madito wu woko ducu. <verse eid="MIC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 5:15" />Dong pi akemo ki kinigana madwong, abiculu kwor ikom lurok mapol mayam pe guye winyo loka dok bene pe guye lubune.”<verse eid="MIC 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Adot ma Rwot tye kwede ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1" />Wuwiny lok me adot ma Rwot okelo ikom Icrael.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MIC 6:1">En waco ni, “Wua, wupid lokwu inyim godi, wek cere ducu owiny dwonwu.”<verse eid="MIC 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:2" />Wun godi, wuwiny lok me adot ma Rwot okelo, ki wun guti me te lobo ducu ma rii nakanaka; pien Rwot tye ki lok me adot ikom jone, en bipido ki jo Icrael.<verse eid="MIC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3" />Rwot Lubanga owaco kuman ni, “Wun jona, atimo gin ango ikomwu? Ceng amiyo wuol i gin ango? Wudoka iye! <verse eid="MIC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:10-16">Nia 4:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:50-51">12:50-51</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note>Pien ceng akwanyowu ki i lobo Ejipt, dok akokowu ki i ot me opii; kun acwalo Moses inyimwu kacel ki Aron ki Miriam bene. <verse eid="MIC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:2-24:25">Wel 22:2—24:25</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:1-4:19">Yoc 3:1—4:19</ref></char></note>Wun jona, wupo lok ma Balak rwot me Moab oporo, ki gin ma Balaam wod pa Beor odoke iye, ki gin ma ceng otime nia i Cittim nio i Gilgal, wek wunge kit ma atiyo kwede pi larowu.”<verse eid="MIC 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma Rwot mito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6" />“Abibino inyim Rwot ki gin ango, ka wek agung inyim Lubanga matye malo? Abibino inyime mono ki gitum awanga, nyo ki roci me mwaka acel acel bo? <verse eid="MIC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7" />Tika Rwot bibedo ki yomcwiny ikom nyogi romi alip ki alip, nyo ikom moo jeituni madwong marom ki pii ma opongo i kulu alip apar libyeny? Kece mono abimiyo latin kayona pi tim aranyina?” <verse eid="MIC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8" />Pe, pe kumeno, Rwot dong onyuti gin maber, in dano; gin ma Rwot mito ki boti en aye timo tic manen atir, ki maro kica, ki wot kacel ki Lubangani ki mwolo.<verse eid="MIC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9" />Rwot dange ki dwon malongo bot wegi taun, dok bedo me ryeko mada me lworo nyinge: “Wuwiny, wun kaka ki wun jo ma wucoke i taun maditi! <verse eid="MIC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10" />Wiya pe twero wil ikom lonyo matye i ot pa dano ma latim marac, kacel ki lapim jami ma pe pimo pim kakare, ma cwinya dag nenone. <verse eid="MIC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11" />Atwero weko dano matye ki mijan marac ma kicaane opong ki kidi me bwola ma pe bene pimo kakareni ningning? <verse eid="MIC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12" />Jowu ma gulony gin jo mager mada dok giunu lucan; dok wun ducu bene wubedo jo ma lugoba keken. <verse eid="MIC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13" />Pimeno dong acako pwodowu, kun awekowu wudong iwi obur ata pi balwu. <verse eid="MIC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14" />Wun wubicamo cam, ento pe wubiyeng, kec binekowu; wubikano jami mogo ento pe wubigwoko, dok gin ma wugwoko abimiyo kibalo woko liweng ikare me mony. <verse eid="MIC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15" />Wubicoyo kodi, ento pe wubikayo; wubiyo moo jeituni, ento pe wubitic ki moone; wubibiyo olok, ento pe wubimato kongo bwinone. <verse eid="MIC 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:23-34">1 Luk 16:23-34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:25-26">21:25-26</ref></char></note>Abitimo magi ducu ikomwu pien wulubu lakit tim maracu pa Omri, ki tic ducu me ot pa Akab; kun bene wulubu tamgi. Pieno abiweko taunwu madito bidong obur, ki jowu gibibedo me acaya, dok jo me rok ducu gibinenowu calo jo ma konygi bene peke woko liweng.”<verse eid="MIC 6:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kit ma kwo pa jo Icrael obale kwede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1" />Dong aneno can! Pien aloke adoko macalo ngat ma kec neko ci ocito i poto olok ikare madong kityeko coko nyige woko calo yat me oro, ma dong kityeko gwero obot olok, ma nyige me acama mo dong peke, wa oduru mo ma okwongo cek ma cwinye mito pe dong tye. <verse eid="MIC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2" />Pe tye ngat mo ma odong i lobo magene, dok bene pe tye ngat mo i lobo ma tiyo gin ma Lubanga mito. Dano ducu gitye kalibo luwotgi me aneka. Dano acel acel dwaro omine. <verse eid="MIC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3" />Gin ducu gitye ki diro pi timo gin marac, gimito timone ki cwinygi ducu. Lutela ki lungolkop gipenyo pi lim me wil i mung. Dano madit tito miti marac matye i cwinye; kitmeno gipiro lok kacel pi timgi ducu wek orwate. <verse eid="MIC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4" />Ngat maber ki ikin gi obedo calo ocok, ngat ma cwinye atir ki ikin gi obedo calo cel okutu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MIC 7:4">Nino ma Lubanga biketo iye can ikomgi, macalo yam ociko bot lunebi ma lukurpiny ma meggi dong oromo. Kombedi dong gitye kacabe acaba dok tamgi onywene woko. <verse eid="MIC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5" />Pe iket geni ikom lawoti, pe ibed ki gen ikom laremi; gwok dogi ikom ngat ma butu ikori; <verse eid="MIC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:35-36">Mat 10:35-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:53">Luk 12:53</ref></char></note>pien ikare man lutino co pe giketo deyo ikom wegigi, lutino anyira bene gipyem ki megigi, ciwod bene pyem ki daane; lukwor pa dano aye gin jo ma i ode.<verse eid="MIC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7" />Ento ki tung bota abigeno Rwot, ma en lalar mera; Lubangana biwinya.<verse eid="MIC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot kelo lar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8" />Pe ium ikoma, in lakwora; ka apoto, dok abia; ka abedo i colpiny, Rwot bibedo dero ma menya. <verse eid="MIC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9" />Abiciro kiniga pa Rwot, pien abalo inyime, nio wang ma en opido loka, kadok bimiya aloyo lok. En bikela i dero; ci abineno lar mere. <verse eid="MIC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10" />Lakwora bene bineno, dok lewic bimako ngat mayam penya ni, “Rwot Lubangani tye kwene?” Abinene ki wanga ka kitye kanyone piny macalo coto matye i dye yoo.<verse eid="MIC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11" />Wun jo Jerucalem, nino me gero cel gogo me taunwu bibino! Inino maca kibimedo wang lobowu cito kamabor. <verse eid="MIC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12" />Inino maca jowu gibibino botwu nia ki i Aciria matye kunyango, ki Ejipt matye kupiny, dok nia ki i Ejipt nio i kulu Euprate, nia ki i nam, nio i nam, dok nia ki i got, nio i got. <verse eid="MIC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13" />Ento lobo bidong nono pi bal pa jo ma gibedo iye, ki bene pi gin marac ma gin timo.<verse eid="MIC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kica pa Rwot ikom jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14" />Kwa joni ki odooni, ai Rwot, ma gin romi ma kimiyi me bedo meri matwal, ma gibedo ken gi i bunga i dye lobo ma ceko cam; wek bene kikwagi i Bacan ki i Gilead macalo ikare macon.<verse eid="MIC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15" />Rwot tii tic me tangoni ikinwa macalo ikare mayam ikelo wa kwede ki i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="MIC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16" />Lurok gibineno, dok lewic bimakogi ikom twer meggi ducu; ci gibiumu doggi ki cinggi; kun itgi biding woko. <verse eid="MIC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17" />Gin biywane i apwa macalo twol, macalo jami ma mol iwi lobo; gibia ki i kabedogi ma kicelo matek, ma nongo komgi myel amyela, dok gibiloke bot Rwot Lubanga ki lworo madwong inyime.<verse eid="MIC 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18" />Anga ma dok Lubanga calo in, ma gonyo bal, ma weko bal pa jone kikome ma gudong? In pe imoko kinigani bedo matwal, pien cwinyi yom pi nyutiwa mar meri ma pe loke. <verse eid="MIC 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19" />In dok ibibedo ki kica ikomwa, in ibinyono balwa piny ite tyeni. Dok ibibolo balwa ducu piny i kut me nam. <verse eid="MIC 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20" />In ibinyutu gen bot Yakobo ki mar meri ma pe loke bot Abraim, macalo ceng ikwongo kwong bot kwariwa nia ikare macon.<verse eid="MIC 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7" />
</usx>